>It would not even occur to me to put on a ring of lev on the planes.

Conflict is nice, but not that important until you get to the Astral
Plane.

The only place slow digestion could matter on the planes is Water (you
shouldn't be spending much time on any of the others).

Teleport control is useless in the Planes.

Free action is nice, but not that important outside Astral.

Levitation is damned handy on Fire, Water, and Air.

Amulets of unchanging are a better solution to the polyself-maintenance
problem, since they're perfectly reliable.

Rings of adornment, protection, gain/increase foo, sustain ability,
searching, stealth, regeneration, warning, protection from shape
changers, and foo resistance are of very limited value on the planes.

Being Very Fast will do more for your chances on the combat-heavy planes
than any ring will.

So: Why use levitation boots for air?
